flowchart TD
    A[data/songs.csv] --> B[Loader: load_songs]
    C[User taste profile] --> D
    B --> D[Ranker: recommend_songs]
    E[Weight config] --> F[Scorer: score_song]
    D --> F
    F --> D
    D --> G[Formatter: render_table]

    H[data/music_notes.md] --> I[Retriever: TF-IDF search]
    D --> I
    I --> J{Relevant note found?}
    J -->|Yes| K[Generator: fun fact from template]
    J -->|No| L[Abstain: no note for this genre]
    K --> M[Fun fact]
    L --> M

    G --> N[Output: ranked table with reasons]
    M --> N

    F --> O[Tester: pytest suite]
    D --> O
    D --> P[Evaluator: determinism, coverage, drift]
    K --> Q[Grounding check: fact must exist in corpus]
    O --> R[tests/results report]
    P --> R
    Q --> R

    N --> S[Human reviews output]
    R --> S
    S --> E
